{"id": "t176-001", "text": "Julia's driving test is on 14 May. She failed the first one on a roundabout and is properly nervous this time. Remind me to text her good luck that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t176-002", "text": "Spoke to Siddharth on the phone. He's applied for the senior analyst role at the council and should hear back by the 3rd of June. If he gets an interview it'll be the week after, and he's already asked his old manager Teresa to be a referee. He's been at his current place for six years and is ready for a change.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applied for the senior analyst role at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 3rd of June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "old manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at his current place for six years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "ready for a change", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t176-003", "text": "Farid lives in Leeds now, just off the ring road. Works for a logistics firm as a planner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "just off the ring road", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Works for a logistics firm as a planner", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t176-004", "text": "Joy has her grade 6 piano exam on Saturday. Her teacher thinks she's ready but Joy doesn't.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 6 piano exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}]}
