{"id": "t176-006", "text": "Rosa's daughter Mia got into the youth orchestra after her audition last week! Rosa was beaming.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the youth orchestra", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "beaming", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t176-007", "text": "Owen had his second interview at the bank this afternoon. I should message him the next day to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t176-008", "text": "Asha's husband is a paramedic and they've got two boys, both at the primary on Elm Road.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "paramedic", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boys", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the primary on Elm Road", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t176-009", "text": "Ignacio's interview got cancelled, they've frozen hiring. He's applying elsewhere instead and seemed fine about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying elsewhere", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t176-010", "text": "Coffee with Vanessa. Her son Tomás sits his A level maths on 9 June and then chemistry a week after. She's more stressed than he is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A level maths", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemistry", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t176-011", "text": "Irina works nights at the hospital lab and lives with her sister in Croydon. Her parents are still in Bucharest and her dad runs a small garage there. She's been in the UK since 2015 and has just applied for citizenship, though she said the forms took her about three weekends to get through.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works nights at the hospital lab", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Croydon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Bucharest", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs a small garage", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "in the UK since 2015", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applied for citizenship", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t176-012", "text": "Ravi passed his driving test! Third attempt. Don't forget to get him a little keyring or something to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a little keyring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t176-013", "text": "Varun mentioned he's sitting the civil service exam on the 21st of November. Asked me not to tell his parents in case it goes badly. Ask him how it went afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "civil service exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 21st of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t176-014", "text": "Tariq's results day is Thursday. He's hoping for the grades to get into Manchester for engineering, otherwise it's Sheffield through clearing. His mum says he's pretending not to care but he hasn't eaten properly all week. His older sister Ruby got her results the same way two years ago and is taking him for breakfast that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hoping for the grades to get into Manchester for engineering", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "older sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakfast", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t176-015", "text": "Mustafa and his wife Zara both have interviews at the same school on 2 October, which is a bit awkward. He's going for head of science, she's applying for the SENCo job. They're keeping it light at home. I should text them both the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interviews at the same school", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text them both", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t176-016", "text": "Ruby's brother Rhys works offshore, two weeks on, two weeks off.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works offshore, two weeks on, two weeks off", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t176-017", "text": "Yetunde has her bar exams in February. She's revising every evening after work and said she's barely sleeping, which isn't like her. Her sister Joy is coming down to stay the week before to cook and keep her sane. I should check in on her in a couple of weeks, and maybe drop off some food.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exams", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down to stay", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a couple of weeks", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t176-018", "text": "Emily got the job at the publishing house! Starts on 1st of March.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the publishing house", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1st of March", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t176-019", "text": "Called Mum. Aunt Helen's grandson has his black belt grading on the 18th.", "spans": [{"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aunt Helen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandson", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "black belt grading", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t176-020", "text": "Aditi's dog Pepper is booked in for the vet on Monday. She also has her nursing interview that afternoon, so she's a bit frazzled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "vet", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursing interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit frazzled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t176-021", "text": "Teresa lives in the flat above the bakery. Her partner is a firefighter in Hackney.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in the flat above the bakery", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "firefighter", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t176-022", "text": "Remind me to ask Javier how his audition for the Ensemble went. It was yesterday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Javier how his audition for the Ensemble went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the Ensemble", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t176-023", "text": "Haruto is studying for his JLPT N1 in December, which he says is the hardest one. He's really into old Ghibli films at the moment and watches them without subtitles as practice. He also mentioned his grandmother in Osaka turns ninety on 3rd of January and the whole family is flying out for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "JLPT N1", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old Ghibli films", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Osaka", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns ninety", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t176-024", "text": "Ioana's mum is a retired GP and still lives in Cluj. Ioana visits twice a year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "retired GP", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Cluj", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "visits twice a year", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t176-025", "text": "Georgia has her final interview with the charity on 27/10. Must send her the notes I made on their annual report the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final interview with the charity", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "27/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her the notes I made on their annual report", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t176-026", "text": "Wiremu said the job at the port fell through, they gave it to an internal candidate. He's gutted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the port", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t176-027", "text": "Long chat with Dana after book club. She's finally applying for the head of HR role at the hospital trust, deadline is 30 September. Her boss is leaving at Christmas and she thinks she has a decent shot, but she's worried about the presentation part of the interview. Her husband Owen is going to do mock questions with her the weekend before. I should offer to read her personal statement.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for the head of HR role at the hospital trust", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock questions", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to read her personal statement", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t176-028", "text": "Siddharth's sister passed her medical finals. The family are having a big dinner on the 5th of August.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "medical finals", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 5th of August", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t176-029", "text": "Note to self: theory test is 3 March, practical sometime in April.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "theory test", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "practical", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in April", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t176-030", "text": "Julia mentioned her dad is a long-distance lorry driver and her mum runs a dog grooming business in Bristol.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "long-distance lorry driver", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs a dog grooming business", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
