{"id": "t176-037", "text": "Ravi's audition for the drama school is on 4 April, and the results come out about a fortnight later. He's been rehearsing his monologue every night. His mum keeps asking me whether he'd actually go if he got in. Don't forget to message him the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the drama school", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4 April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "about a fortnight later", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
