{"id": "t176-039", "text": "Exam board marking finishes on 20 July, so I'm free from the 21st.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Exam board marking", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "20 July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 21st"}]}
{"id": "t176-040", "text": "Helen's interview for the deputy head post was moved to 8 November because one of the governors is away. She's prepping all half term and has to give a twenty minute presentation on behaviour policy. She sounded confident but admitted she hasn't done an interview in eleven years. Remind me to ring her the evening before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview for the deputy head post", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "confident", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
